    "密码和密钥只保存在钥匙串里，界面和诊断信息都不会显示。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passwords and keys are kept only in the keychain and are never shown in the app or in diagnostics."
          }
