          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Imported"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匯入完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入带规则和策略组的订阅后，可以在这里按订阅规则分流和切换策略组。现在全部流量走所选节点。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After you import a subscription with rules and policy groups, you can route by its rules and switch its policy groups here. Right now all traffic goes through the selected node."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匯入帶規則和策略組的訂閱後，可以在這裡按訂閱規則分流和切換策略組。現在全部流量走所選節點。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入插件": {
