    "使用前请阅读用户协议": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read the User Agreement Before You Start"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用前請閱讀用戶協議"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只在你自己的设备上使用，不替别人在其不知情时安装或开启代理、HTTPS 解密和脚本。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use it on your own devices only. Never install or turn on a proxy, HTTPS decryption or scripts for someone without their knowledge."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只在你自己的裝置上使用，不替別人在其不知情時安裝或開啟代理、HTTPS 解密和腳本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS 解密只用于你自己的流量。根证书由你本人在系统设置里手动信任，只解密你列出的域名。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS decryption is for your own traffic only. You trust the root certificate yourself in Settings, and only the domains you list are decrypted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS 解密只用於你自己的流量。根憑證由你本人在系統設定裡手動信任，只解密你列出的網域。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不得用于入侵他人系统、窃取数据，或绕过游戏、支付、登录等服务的安全机制。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Never use it to break into other people's systems, steal data, or get around the security of games, payments, sign-in or other services."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不得用於入侵他人系統、竊取資料，或繞過遊戲、支付、登入等服務的安全機制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本 App 不提供节点或订阅，导入的内容由提供方负责。软件按现状提供，不作担保。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This app provides no nodes or subscriptions; whoever provides what you import is responsible for it. The software is provided as is, without warranty."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本 App 不提供節點或訂閱，匯入的內容由提供方負責。軟體按現狀提供，不作擔保。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "阅读完整协议": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read the Full Agreement"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "閱讀完整協議"
          }
        }
