        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Test"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "測試"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "内核没有回答，请确认已连接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The engine did not answer. Make sure you are connected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "核心沒有回應，請確認已連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "匹配的规则": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Matching Rule"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "比對到的規則"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这条规则要看目标 IP。填上域名解析到的 IP 再测；解析失败时连接会被拒绝。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This rule needs the destination IP. Enter the IP the domain resolves to and test again; if the lookup fails, the connection is rejected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這條規則要看目標 IP。填上網域解析到的 IP 再測；解析失敗時連線會被拒絕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前是全局模式，实际连接不按规则分流。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Global mode is on, so connections do not follow the rules."
          }
