          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "規則測試"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "查看当前规则会把这样的连接交给哪条规则、走哪个出口。不会真的发起连接，也不计入命中次数。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shows which rule the current rules give such a connection to and where it goes. No connection is opened and nothing is counted as a hit."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看目前的規則會把這樣的連線交給哪條規則、走哪個出口。不會真的發起連線，也不計入命中次數。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "还没有连接经过规则。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No connection has gone through the rules yet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "還沒有連線經過規則。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "另有 %lld 条规则还没有命中。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld more rules have no hits yet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另有 %lld 條規則還沒有命中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "清零": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reset"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清零"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "规则命中": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rule Hits"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "規則命中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "规则加载以来每条规则决定了多少个连接。修改规则后重新计数。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How many connections each rule decided since the rules were loaded. Counting restarts when the rules change."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "規則載入以來每條規則決定了多少個連線。修改規則後重新計數。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "订阅里有 PROCESS-NAME 规则。iOS 和 macOS 的隧道分不出连接来自哪个 App，这些规则不会生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The subscription has PROCESS-NAME rules. The tunnel on iOS and macOS cannot tell which app opened a connection, so these rules have no effect."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "訂閱裡有 PROCESS-NAME 規則。iOS 和 macOS 的通道分不出連線來自哪個 App，這些規則不會生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "规则测试、命中与 GeoIP 数据": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rule Test, Hits and GeoIP Data"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "規則測試、命中與 GeoIP 資料"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "规则工具": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rule Tools"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "規則工具"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有这份数据，相关规则不会命中。可以在“GeoIP 与 ASN 数据”里按 URL 添加列表。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No data for this list, so its rules match nothing. Add a list by URL under “GeoIP and ASN Data”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有這份資料，相關規則不會命中。可以在「GeoIP 與 ASN 資料」裡按網址新增清單。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两位国家或地区代码，例如 CN。CN 以外的国家需要在下面的 GeoIP 与 ASN 数据里添加列表。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A two-letter country or region code, such as CN. Countries other than CN need a list under GeoIP and ASN Data below."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩位國家或地區代碼，例如 CN。CN 以外的國家需要在下方的 GeoIP 與 ASN 資料裡新增清單。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AS 号，例如 AS13335。需要在下面的 GeoIP 与 ASN 数据里添加这个 AS 的列表。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An AS number, such as AS13335. Needs a list for this AS under GeoIP and ASN Data below."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AS 號，例如 AS13335。需要在下方的 GeoIP 與 ASN 資料裡新增這個 AS 的清單。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IPV4、IPV6、DOMAIN（带点的域名）或 SIMPLE（不带点的主机名）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "IPV4, IPV6, DOMAIN (a domain with a dot) or SIMPLE (a host name without one)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "IPV4、IPV6、DOMAIN（帶點的網域）或 SIMPLE（不帶點的主機名稱）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 作为网关时，按在“设备名”里给局域网设备起的名字匹配。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With the Mac as the gateway, matches the names given to LAN devices under Device Names."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 作為閘道時，依在「裝置名稱」裡為區域網路裝置取的名稱比對。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TCP、UDP、QUIC、HTTP、HTTPS、STUN，或 DOH、DOQ（只匹配经代理发出的加密 DNS 查询）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TCP, UDP, QUIC, HTTP, HTTPS, STUN, or DOH and DOQ (only the encrypted DNS queries sent through the proxy)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TCP、UDP、QUIC、HTTP、HTTPS、STUN，或 DOH、DOQ（只比對經代理送出的加密 DNS 查詢）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "写设备的 IP 地址和 1 到 64 个字符的名字（不含逗号）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter the device's IP address and a name of 1 to 64 characters without commas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "填寫裝置的 IP 位址和 1 到 64 個字元的名稱（不含逗號）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发起连接的源端口，一个端口或 起-止 范围。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The source port the connection comes from: one port or a start-end range."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "發起連線的來源連接埠，一個連接埠或 起-止 範圍。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "名字": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名稱"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前网络：SSID:名称、BSSID:地址、ROUTER:网关 IP、TYPE:WIFI / WIRED / CELLULAR，或本机地址所在的网段。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The current network: SSID:name, BSSID:address, ROUTER:gateway IP, TYPE:WIFI / WIRED / CELLULAR, or a network this device's address is in."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目前網路：SSID:名稱、BSSID:位址、ROUTER:閘道 IP、TYPE:WIFI / WIRED / CELLULAR，或本機位址所在的網段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最多 %lld 个设备名。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At most %lld device names."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最多 %lld 個裝置名稱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "给把 Mac 当作网关的设备起名字，DEVICE-NAME 规则按名字匹配（不区分大小写）。设备按连接来源的 IP 认出，最好在路由器里给它固定地址。右键可删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name the devices that use this Mac as their gateway; DEVICE-NAME rules match these names, ignoring case. A device is known by the IP its connections come from, so give it a fixed address in your router. Right-click to delete."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "為把 Mac 當作閘道的裝置取名，DEVICE-NAME 規則依名稱比對（不分大小寫）。裝置依連線來源的 IP 辨認，最好在路由器裡為它固定位址。按右鍵可刪除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "蜂窝网络制式，例如 LTE、NR（5G）。只在使用蜂窝网络时匹配。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The cellular radio technology, such as LTE or NR (5G). Matches only on cellular."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "行動網路制式，例如 LTE、NR（5G）。只在使用行動網路時比對。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "订阅里有 CELLULAR-RADIO 规则。Mac 读不到蜂窝网络制式，这些规则不会生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The subscription has CELLULAR-RADIO rules. A Mac cannot read the cellular radio technology, so these rules have no effect."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "訂閱裡有 CELLULAR-RADIO 規則。Mac 讀不到行動網路制式，這些規則不會生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "订阅里有 DEVICE-NAME 规则。iPhone 和 iPad 不给局域网设备起名，这些规则不会生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The subscription has DEVICE-NAME rules. iPhone and iPad name no LAN devices, so these rules have no effect."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "訂閱裡有 DEVICE-NAME 規則。iPhone 和 iPad 不為區域網路裝置取名，這些規則不會生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
