        }
      }
    },
    "pcapng 可用 Wireshark 打开，HAR 可导入浏览器开发者工具或其他抓包工具。导出内容可能包含账号、Cookie 等敏感信息，请只发给信任的人。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open pcapng with Wireshark; import HAR into browser developer tools or other capture tools. Exports may contain accounts, cookies and other sensitive data, so send them only to people you trust."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "pcapng 可用 Wireshark 開啟，HAR 可匯入瀏覽器開發者工具或其他抓包工具。匯出內容可能包含帳號、Cookie 等敏感資訊，請只傳給信任的人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
