    "收到的数据": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Received Data"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "收到的資料"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "设置 > 通用 > 关于本机 > 证书信任设置，打开这张证书的开关。名称需与下方一致，旧证书的开关不算。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Settings > General > About > Certificate Trust Settings, turn on the switch for this certificate. Its name must match the one below; an old certificate's switch doesn't count."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設定 > 一般 > 關於本機 > 憑證信任設定，開啟這張憑證的開關。名稱需與下方一致，舊憑證的開關不算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "站点标识是本机按主机名生成的字母，不联网取图标。HTTPS、QUIC 等标签按端口推断。上传、下载为该连接经隧道的字节数。目标域名来自请求本身或 TLS SNI / HTTP Host，只保存在内存里，下次连接或退出 App 时清空。在右上角“更多”中开始抓包后，新的连接可在详情里查看和导出内容（每个方向前 64 KiB，HTTPS 需启用解密才是明文）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Site badges are letters made on this device from the host name; no icons are fetched. Tags such as HTTPS and QUIC are inferred from the port. Upload and download are the bytes each connection moved through the tunnel. Target names come from the request itself or its TLS SNI / HTTP Host, are kept only in memory and are cleared on the next connection or when the app quits. After you start capturing from “More” at the top right, new connections' content can be viewed and exported in their details (the first 64 KiB in each direction; HTTPS is plain text only with decryption on)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "站點標識是本機按主機名稱產生的字母，不連網取圖示。HTTPS、QUIC 等標籤按連接埠推斷。上傳、下載為該連線經隧道的位元組數。目標網域來自請求本身或 TLS SNI / HTTP Host，只儲存在記憶體裡，下次連線或結束 App 時清空。在右上角「更多」中開始擷取後，新的連線可在詳細資訊裡檢視和匯出內容（每個方向前 64 KiB，HTTPS 需啟用解密才是明文）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重定向到": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Redirected to"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新導向到"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重定向规则": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Redirect rule"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新導向規則"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个连接建立时没有在抓包。在请求列表右上角“更多”中开始抓包后，新的连接可以查看和导出内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Capture was off when this connection opened. After you start capturing from “More” at the top right of the request list, new connections' content can be viewed and exported."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個連線建立時沒有在擷取。在請求列表右上角「更多」中開始擷取後，新的連線可以檢視和匯出內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，应用查询域名时立即拿到 198.18.0.0/15（IPv6 为 fc00::/18）内的临时地址，连接时再还原成域名按规则分流、由代理解析，首次连接更快，非 HTTP/TLS 协议也能按域名分流。局域网、NTP、STUN、Apple 推送和联网检测等域名仍返回真实地址。关闭或更改后，个别应用可能需要重新打开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, apps that look up a domain get a temporary address in 198.18.0.0/15 (fc00::/18 for IPv6) at once; on connecting it is turned back into the domain, routed by the rules and resolved by the proxy. First connections are faster, and protocols other than HTTP/TLS can be routed by domain too. Local network, NTP, STUN, Apple push and connectivity-check domains still get their real addresses. After you turn this off or change it, some apps may need to be reopened."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開啟後，應用程式查詢網域時立即拿到 198.18.0.0/15（IPv6 為 fc00::/18）內的臨時位址，連線時再還原成網域按規則分流、由代理解析，首次連線更快，非 HTTP/TLS 協定也能按網域分流。區域網路、NTP、STUN、Apple 推播和連網偵測等網域仍回傳真實位址。關閉或變更後，個別應用程式可能需要重新開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "说明": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Note"
          }
        },
