            "value": "從本機重新發出這個請求，不帶 Cookie 儲存，不跟隨重新導向。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请求体没有完整抓到，只能编辑后重放。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The request body wasn't fully captured, so it can only be replayed after editing."
