    },
    "改写未生效：流式响应": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rewrite not applied: streamed response"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "改寫未生效：串流回應"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "由改写规则直接应答": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Answered by a rewrite rule"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由改寫規則直接回應"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "流式响应，未保留正文": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Streamed response; body not kept"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "串流回應，未保留內文"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "内容过大，之后不再解密": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Too large; no longer decrypted after this"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "內容過大，之後不再解密"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只解压出开头部分（正文没有完整抓到，或解压后超过 16 MiB）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only the beginning was decompressed (the body wasn't fully captured, or it is over 16 MiB decompressed)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只解壓縮出開頭部分（內文沒有完整擷取到，或解壓縮後超過 16 MiB）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "订阅与节点": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Subscriptions & Nodes"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "訂閱與節點"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本地规则": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local Rules"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本機規則"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "分流规则": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Routing Rules"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分流規則"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "订阅没有自带规则时，规则模式按这里你自己的规则和规则集分流，其余走代理。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When a subscription has no rules of its own, rule mode routes by your rules and rule sets here; everything else goes through the proxy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "訂閱沒有自帶規則時，規則模式按這裡你自己的規則和規則集分流，其餘走代理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从配置文件导入规则": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import Rules from a Config File"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "從設定檔匯入規則"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "清空我的规则": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clear My Rules"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清空我的規則"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从上到下匹配，先匹配先生效，全部排在订阅规则前面。“代理”指订阅的第一个策略组。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Matched top to bottom; the first match wins. All of them come before the subscription's rules. “Proxy” means the subscription's first policy group."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "從上到下比對，先符合先生效，全部排在訂閱規則前面。「代理」指訂閱的第一個策略組。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从上到下匹配，先匹配先生效：你的规则、规则集，其余走代理。“代理”指当前选中的节点。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Matched top to bottom; the first match wins: your rules, then rule sets, then everything else through the proxy. “Proxy” means the selected node."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "從上到下比對，先符合先生效：你的規則、規則集，其餘走代理。「代理」指目前選中的節點。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "添加规则集": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add Rule Set"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新增規則集"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从配置导入": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import from Config"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "從設定匯入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "清空你添加的全部规则？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clear all the rules you added?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清空你新增的全部規則？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "添加第一条规则": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add Your First Rule"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新增第一條規則"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按域名、IP、端口等写规则，兼容常见规则语法。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Write rules by domain, IP, port and more, compatible with common rule syntax."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按網域、IP、連接埠等寫規則，相容常見規則語法。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通过链接添加规则集": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add a Rule Set by Link"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "透過連結新增規則集"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "填任意常见格式规则列表的 https 链接，由内核经代理下载，每天自动更新。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter the https link of a rule list in any common format. The engine downloads it through the proxy and updates it daily."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "填任意常見格式規則列表的 https 連結，由核心經代理下載，每天自動更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "局域网和本机地址直连": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Direct for Local Network and This Device"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "區域網路和本機位址直連"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "其余流量": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Everything Else"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其餘流量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有被上面规则和规则集匹配的流量都走代理。只在规则模式下生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Traffic that no rule or rule set above matches goes through the proxy. Applies only in rule mode."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有被上面規則和規則集比對到的流量都走代理。只在規則模式下生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例如 广告拦截": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "e.g. Ad blocking"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "例如 廣告攔截"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "链接": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Link"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "連結"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "支持常见的 .list 规则列表和 classical / domain 列表（https）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supports common .list rule lists and classical / domain lists (https)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支援常見的 .list 規則列表和 classical / domain 列表（https）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "策略": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Policy"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "策略"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "匹配后": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When Matched"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "符合後"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除规则集": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete Rule Set"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刪除規則集"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "编辑规则集": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Edit Rule Set"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "編輯規則集"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "链接必须是 https 地址": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The link must be an https address"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "連結必須是 https 位址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "值": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Value"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不解析域名（no-resolve）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Don't Resolve Domains (no-resolve)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不解析網域（no-resolve）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "编辑规则": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Edit Rule"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "編輯規則"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "匹配这个域名和它的所有子域名。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Matches this domain and all its subdomains."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "符合這個網域和它的所有子網域。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "内置 cn 列表；订阅自带同名规则集时用订阅的。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The built-in cn list; when the subscription has a rule set of the same name, the subscription's is used."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "內建 cn 列表；訂閱自帶同名規則集時用訂閱的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一个端口或 起-止 范围，例如 6000-6100。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A port or a start-end range, e.g. 6000-6100."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一個連接埠或 起-迄 範圍，例如 6000-6100。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "常见规则语法的规则列表 https 地址，经代理每天下载一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The https address of a rule list in common rule syntax, downloaded once a day through the proxy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "常見規則語法的規則列表 https 位址，經代理每天下載一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "兼容常见规则语法中的同名规则。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compatible with the rule of the same name in common rule syntax."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相容常見規則語法中的同名規則。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这条规则的值不对，内核不会接受。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This rule's value is wrong; the engine won't accept it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這條規則的值不對，核心不會接受。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "粘贴剪贴板": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paste from Clipboard"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "貼上剪貼簿"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以粘贴整份配置（只读 [Rule] 段）或每行一条规则。DIRECT、REJECT 保留，其他策略名都当作代理；FINAL 和不支持的类型会跳过。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paste a whole config (only its [Rule] section is read) or one rule per line. DIRECT and REJECT are kept and every other policy name counts as the proxy; FINAL and unsupported types are skipped."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以貼上整份設定（只讀 [Rule] 段）或每行一條規則。DIRECT、REJECT 保留，其他策略名稱都當作代理；FINAL 和不支援的類型會略過。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入规则": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import Rules"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匯入規則"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用本机内容应答请求，或把请求转到另一个地址。也可以在请求详情里从抓到的请求一键生成。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Answer requests with content from this device, or send them to another address. You can also make one from a captured request in its details."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用本機內容回應請求，或把請求轉到另一個位址。也可以在請求詳細資訊裡從擷取的請求一鍵產生。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "还没有映射。在请求详情里选“映射到本地”或“映射到远程”，或点下方添加。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No mappings yet. Choose “Map Local” or “Map Remote” in a request's details, or add one below."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "還沒有對應。在請求詳細資訊裡選「對應到本機」或「對應到遠端」，或點下方新增。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Map Local（本地应答）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Map Local (answer locally)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Map Local（本機回應）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Map Remote（转到其他地址）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Map Remote (send elsewhere)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Map Remote（轉到其他位址）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "添加映射": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add Mapping"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新增對應"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从上到下第一条匹配的生效。需要先在 扩展 › HTTPS 解密证书 中安装并信任根证书，HTTPS 请求才能被映射。Map Remote 用 307 重定向发往新地址，方法和请求体保持不变。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first match from the top applies. HTTPS requests can be mapped only after you install and trust the root certificate in Extensions › HTTPS Decryption Certificate. Map Remote sends a 307 redirect to the new address, keeping the method and body."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "從上到下第一條符合的生效。需要先在 擴充功能 › HTTPS 解密憑證 中安裝並信任根憑證，HTTPS 請求才能被對應。Map Remote 用 307 重新導向發往新位址，方法和請求內文保持不變。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "映射": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mappings"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "對應"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除映射": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete Mapping"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刪除對應"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "名称（可选）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name (optional)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名稱（選填）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Map Local：用这里写的响应直接应答，不连接服务器。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Map Local: answers with the response written here, without connecting to the server."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Map Local：用這裡寫的回應直接回應，不連線伺服器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Map Remote：把请求转到另一个地址，例如测试环境或本机开发服务器。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Map Remote: sends the request to another address, such as a test environment or a development server on this machine."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Map Remote：把請求轉到另一個位址，例如測試環境或本機開發伺服器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "匹配": {
      "localizations": {
