    "脚本在隧道内的 QuickJS 中运行，可以读取和修改所在插件 [MITM] 主机的请求和响应，不能自行联网。只运行允许时下载的那一份；%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scripts run in QuickJS inside the tunnel. They can read and change requests and responses for their plugin's [MITM] hosts and can't go online by themselves. Only the copy downloaded when you allowed it runs. %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "腳本在隧道內的 QuickJS 中執行，可以讀取和修改所在外掛 [MITM] 主機的請求和回應，不能自行連網。只執行允許時下載的那一份；%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将从 %@ 下载。脚本可以查看和改写解密后的流量，请只允许你信任的来源。地址上的内容之后变了，需要重新允许。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It will be downloaded from %@. Scripts can view and rewrite decrypted traffic, so allow only sources you trust. If the content at the address changes later, you need to allow it again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "將從 %@ 下載。腳本可以檢視和改寫解密後的流量，請只允許你信任的來源。位址上的內容之後變了，需要重新允許。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
