    "手机和 Mac 连同一个 Wi-Fi，把手机的 Wi-Fi 代理设成 Mac，手机的请求就会出现在请求页。只接受局域网里的设备，默认还要填用户名和密码；断开连接时一并关闭。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Put the phone and the Mac on the same Wi-Fi and set the phone's Wi-Fi proxy to the Mac; the phone's requests then appear on the Requests page. Only devices on the local network are accepted, by default they must enter a username and password, and it turns off when you disconnect."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手機和 Mac 連同一個 Wi-Fi，把手機的 Wi-Fi 代理設成 Mac，手機的請求就會出現在請求頁。只接受區域網路裡的裝置，預設還要填使用者名稱和密碼；斷開連線時一併關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
